## ENDPOINT: URL API is caccessed from
## CALL: A request made to an API
## API: application programming interface
## Response: The data returned from an API call
## JSON: JavaScript Object Notation, a lightweight data-interchange format
## Entity: A single object or record in a database

## POST: A request method used to send data to an API to create a new resource
## GET: A request method used to retrieve data from an API
## PUT: A request method used to send data to an API to update an existing resource
## PATCH: A request method used to send data to an API to partially update an existing resource
## DELETE: A request method used to send data to an API to delete an existing resource